### Dynamic variables
POST http://api.example.com/dynamic
Content-Type: application/json

{"id": "$uuid", "when": "$timestamp", "n": "$randomInt", "guid": "$random.uuid", "n2": "$random.integer(1,100)"}

### Unmappable and dotenv
GET http://api.example.com/x?k={{$dotenv API_KEY}}&other=$customToken
